That was a hard battle, wasn't it? You did very well.
We kept the world from entering a new ice age and saved the Tree of Life.
The glacial river was originally created by the Ice Flame of the Snowstorm Dragon, which was fleeing from hunters. After being abandoned, the girl wandered until she found other mutants and came to live with them, receiving the name Snow Lady.
That was the Snow Tribe, which hid from the dragon until the young girl found it and became its friend.

Now they can meet again and live in peace.
I hope the Snow Lady is not manipulated by anyone else. She has suffered too much.

Receive the Superior Roitra as a reward for your effort.
